        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS1575, Sobe 15-3/4\" Glass Shampoo Shelf</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe contemporary design of the Sobe Series Shelf makes is perfect for modern styled homes. This 15-3/4 inch glass shelf has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. The brackets are made of solid brass  and the shelf is made of glass. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for and when mounted to the wall, this shampoo shelf will make an ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS1575-specifications.gif?v=1704354550\" width=\"600\" height=\"279\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS1575 15-3/4\" Shampoo Shelf With Glass Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/27-5-8-inch-modern-shampoo-shelf-deltana-bbs2750\"><b>27-5/8\" Sobe Glass Shelf</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe 27-1/2 Inch Bathroom Shelf:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass wall mount with a glass shelf.</li>\r\n<li>Shelf Width: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 15-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS1575.pdf?v=1691095348\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS1575 15-3/4\" Shampoo Shelf With Glass Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 shelf, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "15-3/4 Inch Modern Shampoo Shelf, Deltana BBS1575",
                "description": "Deltana BBS1575 15-3/4 Inch Solid Brass Shelf - The contemporary design of the Sobe Series Shelf makes is perfect for modern styled homes. This 15-3/4 inch glass shelf has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. The brackets are made of solid brass (available in oil rubbed bronze, polished chrome, polished nickel and satin nickel finishes) and the glass self is made of glass. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for and when mounted to the wall, this shampoo shelf will make an ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.",
